# Eater CPU Emulator

A simple emulator (simulator?) for [Ben Eater's 8 Bit Breadboard CPU](https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLowKtXNTBypGqImE405J2565dvjafglHU).

Run it like this:

```
go run . add.ram
```

Or single-step through a program with:

```
go run . --single-step add.ram
```

Press return to advance to the next clock cycle.
